        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"78821ffb-5825-4a01-bb64-a4548a332dff\",\"review_text\":\"It's not good at all\"},{\"review_id\":\"275485b9-2fef-49bc-8fb5-4d2b2dfff293\",\"review_text\":\"Tbh I think it's better than sound cloud, I can listen 2 my music,(favorite artist) which I love💚💚💚, just Spotify is better than any music app I had used.\"},{\"review_id\":\"2bc3d7b4-1cdd-46a2-8f26-fb408f0e332d\",\"review_text\":\"Why after update Spotify app is not logging in with username hope you'll fix that issue Best regards\"},{\"review_id\":\"81fb9ad9-8f25-435d-8de1-f37fef4d7905\",\"review_text\":\"Osm n best app it contains all like, music, songs n podcasts which are so cool to listen..\"},{\"review_id\":\"0a8e5fb6-9c49-4b38-95b0-e6e2624a1dcb\",\"review_text\":\"To many repeated ads . Other then that it great .\"},{\"review_id\":\"86d9f3ac-4d21-47a3-9c83-adffce27b208\",\"review_text\":\"I hate this app saveden ،،😡\"},{\"review_id\":\"ff69152d-6844-4124-a62b-12449dd82f67\",\"review_text\":\"The best music app out there fr but the only downside is TOO MANY ADS.\"},{\"review_id\":\"33b73ab1-3e43-437a-81ac-1c9cd822dc97\",\"review_text\":\"Absolute perfection 🥰 💞 👌\"},{\"review_id\":\"000b587e-b833-476b-8063-801f4ef36672\",\"review_text\":\"Maja nahi aya\"},{\"review_id\":\"bcb637b0-3069-4942-b03e-592265ce56e1\",\"review_text\":\"Amazing I love it! Unlimited skips with no ads is totally worth it, plus all the podcast and options available. My fav\"}]}"
